  const soloStory=[['OAKHAVEN','You knew every path home. You thought Oakhaven would always be there.','Prologue'],['A PROMISE','Father: Strength is easy. Kindness is a choice. Keep your oath, little oak.','Father'],['THE NIGHT OF CINDERS','Father: Into the cellar. Now. Whatever you hear, stay hidden.','Father'],['THE OBSIDIAN DUKE','The Duke: Kneel, oathkeeper. Father: You will not touch my child.','The last night'],['THE LAST STAND','Steel rang. Your father stood between the Duke and the cellar door.','Oakhaven'],['ASH AND SILENCE','By dawn, the village was ash. You kept his broken sword—and his promise.','Oakhaven · the morning after'],['EIGHT YEARS LATER','Eight years later. Eighteen years old. No longer hiding.','The Forgotten Watchtower'],['YOUR OATH BEGINS','Garrow: A blade can avenge the dead. A shield can still protect the living.','Old Man Garrow']];
